    pages:
    - Years pass. You grow. You learn. Each skill you gain becomes something greater!
    - Every skill belongs to one of six kinds. Together, they are called RIASEC.
    - R is for Realistic. These are the doers. They like to build, fix, and work
      with their hands.
    - I is for Investigative. These are the thinkers. They like to ask questions
      and solve puzzles.
    - A is for Artistic. These are the creators. They like to draw, write, and make
      new things.
    - S is for Social. These are the helpers. They like to teach, care for, and guide
      others.
    - E is for Enterprising. These are the leaders. They like to convince people
      and take charge.
    - C is for Conventional. These are the organizers. They like to sort, count,
      and keep things in order.
    - The dreams grow sharper now - flashes of the disaster ahead.
    - The future shifts every time. The threat is never the same.
    - Then, just before you become an adult, it happens. The disaster strikes!
    - This is it. Everything you've learned decides what comes next!
